{"id":"e4f5b9a29710000f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-omega-jump.md","title":"集合与度的 ω 跳跃","display":"df-omega-jump — 集合与度的 ω 跳跃","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-omega-jump","aliases":["20-df-omega-jump"],"display":"df-omega-jump — 集合与度的 ω 跳跃","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 6.5.1；Exercise 6.5.9","source_printed_pages":[141,144],"source_pdf_pages":[175,178],"depends_on":["[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-deg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-omega-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-omega-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-jump — 集合与度的 ω 跳跃"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.5.1；Exercise 6.5.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>141</span><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA^{(\\omega)}:=\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle:x\\in A^{(n)}\\},\\qquad\\mathbf a^{(\\omega)}:=\\deg_T(A^{(\\omega)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA^{(\\omega)}:=\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle:x\\in A^{(n)}\\},\\qquad\\mathbf a^{(\\omega)}:=\\deg_T(A^{(\\omega)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,n\\rangle\\)</span> 的次序，故与上游第一坐标为列号的可数 join 之间需交换坐标。度版本的代表元无关性由下一个独立原子证明；不能仅从每个有限层分别有某个归约推出无限 join 归约，必须有随层数统一的指标编译。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5.1；Exercise 6.5.9；印刷页 141, 144；PDF 第 175, 178 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"2